</name><name><surname>Marrin</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The need for needs assessment in continuing medical education</article-title><source>BMJ</source><year>2004</year><volume>328</volume><issue>7446</issue><fpage>999</fpage><lpage>1001</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/bmj.328.7446.999</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Norman GR, Shannon SI, Marrin ML. The need for needs assessment in continuing medical education. BMJ. 2004;328(7446):999&#x02013;1001, Apr 24. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15105326</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR7"><label>7.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Regehr</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Eva</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Self-assessment, self-direction, and the self-regulating professional</article-title><source>Clin Orthop Relat Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>449</volume><fpage>34</fpage><lpage>38</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Regehr G, Eva K. Self-assessment, self-direction, and the self-regulating professional. Clin Orthop Relat Res. 2006;449:34&#x02013;8, May 25. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16735869</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR8"><label>8.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sommers</surname><given-names>LS</given-names></name><name><surname>Hacker</surname><given-names>TW</given-names></name><name><surname>Schneider</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Pugno</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><name><surname>Garrett</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A descriptive study of managed-care hassles in 26 practices</article-title><source>West J Med</source><year>2001</year><volume>174</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>175</fpage><lpage>179</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/ewjm.174.3.175</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Sommers LS, Hacker TW, Schneider DM, Pugno PA, Garrett JB. A descriptive study of managed-care hassles in 26 practices. West J Med. 2001;174(3):175&#x02013;9, Mar. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11238348</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR9"><label>9.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sommers</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Marton</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The curriculum template: creating continuing medical education curricula for physicians in practice in managed care settings</article-title><source>West J Med</source><year>2000</year><volume>173</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>337</fpage><lpage>340</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/ewjm.173.5.337</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Sommers L, Marton K. The curriculum template: creating continuing medical education curricula for physicians in practice in managed care settings. West J Med. 2000;173(5):337&#x02013;40. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11069875</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR10"><label>10.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>O&#x02019;Connor</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Adding value to evidence-based clinical guidelines</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>2005</year><volume>294</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>741</fpage><lpage>743</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/jama.294.6.741</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">O&#x02019;Connor PJ. Adding value to evidence-based clinical guidelines. JAMA. 2005;294(6):741&#x02013;3, Aug 10. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16091578</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-gr